                                    Marketplace Repricing Engine
                                    <span
                                        class="inline-arrow blue"
                                        aria-hidden="true">→</span
                                    >
                                </a>
                            </h4>

                            <p>
                                An Excel-based pricing system built to manage
                                1,000+ live listings and 10,000+ priced
                                variations using imported market data,
                                structured pricing logic, and bulk-update
                                workflows.
                            </p>

                            <div class="metrics">
                                <div><strong>1,000+</strong><span>live listings</span></div>
                                <div><strong>10K+</strong><span>priced variations</span></div>
                                <div><strong>16K+</strong><span>prices refreshed per run</span></div>
                            </div>

                            <SkillTagList
                                skills={[
                                    "excel",
                                    "pricing-operations",
                                    "operational-scaling",
                                ]}
                            />

                            <a
                                class="view-link"
                                href="/projects/rocketeers/repricing/"
                                >View case study ↗</a
                            >
                        </article>

                        <!-- =====================================
                             03 — FINANCIAL & OPERATIONS TRACKER
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="rocketeers-card card-finance project-link">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/rocketeers/financial-tracker/"
                                aria-label="View the Financial and Operations Tracker case study"
                            ></a>
                            <div class="card-top">
                                <span class="card-number green"> 03 </span>

                                <span
                                    class="card-symbol green"
                                    aria-hidden="true"
                                >
                                    ↗
                                </span>
                            </div>

                            <h4>
                                <a
                                    class="card-title-link"
                                    href="/projects/rocketeers/financial-tracker/"
                                >
                                    Financial & Operations Tracker
                                    <span
                                        class="inline-arrow green"
                                        aria-hidden="true">→</span
                                    >
                                </a>
                            </h4>

                            <p>
                                A multi-sheet Excel tracker covering turnover,
                                orders, inventory, trading activity, fees,
                                cancellations, and approximate profitability
                                across the growing operation.
                            </p>

                            <div class="metrics">
                                <div><strong>$55.6K</strong><span>eBay turnover, 2017–2019</span></div>
                                <div><strong>4,154</strong><span>historical orders</span></div>
                                <div><strong>25</strong><span>populated months</span></div>
                            </div>

                            <!-- Historical financial totals are covered on the case study, not presented as lifetime figures. -->

                            <SkillTagList
                                skills={[
                                    "excel",
                                    "commercial-analysis",
                                    "operational-reporting",
                                ]}
                            />

                            <a
                                class="view-link"
                                href="/projects/rocketeers/financial-tracker/"
                                >View case study ↗</a
                            >
                        </article>
                    </div>
                </section>

                <!-- =============================================
                     OTHER PROJECTS
                     ============================================= -->

                <section
                    class="other-projects"
                    aria-labelledby="other-projects-title"
                >
                    <div class="other-projects-heading">
                        <p class="eyebrow">Selected systems</p>

                        <h3 id="other-projects-title">
                            Practical systems beyond Rocketeers.
                        </h3>

                        <p>Automation, e-commerce, data, and a little maths.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="track-filter" role="group" aria-label="Filter projects by area">
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="true" data-track-filter="all">All</button>
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="automation">Automation</button>
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="ecommerce">E-commerce & web</button>
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="data">Data & analytics</button>
                        <button type="button" aria-pressed="false" data-track-filter="lab">Maths lab</button>
                    </div>
                    <p class="visually-hidden" aria-live="polite" data-track-status></p>

                    <div class="other-project-grid">
                        <!-- =====================================
                             AI JOB DISCOVERY & OUTREACH AUTOMATION
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="other-project-card project-link" data-track="automation">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/ai-job-outreach/"
                                aria-label="View the AI Job Discovery and Outreach Automation case study"
                            ></a>
                            <div class="project-visual ai-visual">
                                <svg class="funnel-icon" viewBox="0 0 120 100" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path class="funnel-shape" d="M14 14 H106 L72 52 V82 L48 92 V52 Z" />
                                    <circle class="funnel-drop d1" cx="34" cy="6" r="4" />
                                    <circle class="funnel-drop d2" cx="60" cy="6" r="4" />
                                    <circle class="funnel-drop d3" cx="86" cy="6" r="4" />
                                    <circle class="funnel-out" cx="60" cy="96" r="4" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>

                            <div class="other-project-body">
                                <h4>
                                    <a
                                        class="card-title-link"
                                        href="/projects/ai-job-outreach/"
                                    >
                                        AI Job Discovery & Outreach Automation
                                        <span
                                            class="inline-arrow blue"
                                            aria-hidden="true">→</span
                                        >
                                    </a>
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    From a Python and Gemini job-API prototype
                                    to a nine-ATS Google Apps Script job funnel
                                    with deduplication, conservative screening,
                                    and human review batches.
                                </p>

                                <SkillTagList
                                    skills={[
                                        "google-apps-script",
                                        "python",
                                        "deduplication",
                                        "ai-workflow-implementation",
                                    ]}
                                />

                                <a
                                    class="view-link"
                                    href="/projects/ai-job-outreach/"
                                    >View case study ↗</a
                                >
                            </div>
                        </article>

                        <!-- =====================================
                             MARKETPLACE OPPORTUNITY INTELLIGENCE
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="other-project-card project-link" data-track="automation">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/rocketeers-intelligence/"
                                aria-label="View the Marketplace Opportunity Intelligence case study"
                            ></a>
                            <div class="project-visual intel-visual">
                                <svg class="intel-graph" viewBox="0 0 160 100" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d="M22 50 L70 22 L70 78 Z M70 22 L132 50 L70 78" />
                                    <circle cx="22" cy="50" r="9" />
                                    <circle cx="70" cy="22" r="9" />
                                    <circle cx="70" cy="78" r="9" />
                                    <rect x="118" y="36" width="28" height="28" rx="6" />
                                </svg>
                            </div>

                            <div class="other-project-body">
                                <h4>
                                    <a class="card-title-link" href="/projects/rocketeers-intelligence/">
                                        Marketplace Opportunity Intelligence
                                        <span class="inline-arrow blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                                    </a>
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    An n8n and PostgreSQL pipeline that turns
                                    public-domain museum archives into
                                    reviewable product-niche evidence, with
                                    idempotent ingestion and append-only human
                                    reviews.
                                </p>

                                <SkillTagList
                                    skills={["workflow-automation", "sql", "rest-api-integration", "human-oversight"]}
                                />

                                <a class="view-link" href="/projects/rocketeers-intelligence/">View case study ↗</a>
                            </div>
                        </article>

                        <!-- =====================================
                             RAME
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="other-project-card project-link" data-track="ecommerce">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/rame/"
                                aria-label="View the RAMÉ Creative Space case study"
                            ></a>
                            <div class="project-visual rame-visual">
                                <div class="rame-mini" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <span class="rame-mini-word">RAMÉ</span>
                                    <span class="rame-mini-pill">Creative Space</span>
                                    <svg class="rame-mini-star" viewBox="0 0 100 100">
                                        <path d="M50 4 L60 40 L96 50 L60 60 L50 96 L40 60 L4 50 L40 40 Z" />
                                    </svg>
                                    <span class="rame-mini-dot"></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="other-project-body">
                                <h4>
                                    <a
                                        class="card-title-link"
                                        href="/projects/rame/"
                                    >
                                        RAMÉ Creative Space
                                        <span
                                            class="inline-arrow blue"
                                            aria-hidden="true">→</span
                                        >
                                    </a>
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    An in-progress client store built with
                                    WordPress, WooCommerce, Elementor, and
                                    targeted CSS, covering responsive pages,
                                    custom-order inquiries, side-cart styling,
                                    and practical site maintenance.
                                </p>

                                <SkillTagList
                                    skills={[
                                        "wordpress",
                                        "woocommerce",
                                        "elementor",
                                        "theme-customization",
                                    ]}
                                />

                                <a class="view-link" href="/projects/rame/"
                                    >View case study ↗</a
                                >
                            </div>
                        </article>

                        <!-- =====================================
                             CHESS ANALYTICS
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="other-project-card project-link" data-track="data">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/chess-analytics/"
                                aria-label="View the Chess Analytics case study"
                            ></a>

                            <div class="project-visual data-visual">
                                <div class="chess-icon" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <span class="chess-ring"></span>
                                    <span class="chess-knight">♞</span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <div class="other-project-body">
                                <h4>
                                    <a class="card-title-link" href="/projects/chess-analytics/">
                                        Chess Analytics
                                        <span class="inline-arrow blue" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                                    </a>
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    Analysis of a 500,000-game Lichess sample,
                                    exploring rating upsets and opening
                                    performance through Python, DuckDB SQL,
                                    Power BI, and interactive web dashboards.
                                </p>

                                <SkillTagList
                                    skills={["python", "sql", "power-bi", "data-visualisation"]}
                                />

                                <a class="view-link" href="/projects/chess-analytics/">View case study ↗</a>
                            </div>
                        </article>

                        <!-- =====================================
                             GYM PROGRESS SYSTEM
                             ===================================== -->

                        <article class="other-project-card project-link" data-track="data">
                            <a
                                class="card-cover-link"
                                href="/projects/gym-progress/"
                                aria-label="View the Gym Progress System case study"
                            ></a>
                            <div class="project-visual gym-visual">
                                <svg class="gym-icon" viewBox="0 0 140 90" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path class="gym-grid" d="M10 80 H130 M10 55 H130 M10 30 H130" />
                                    <polyline class="gym-line" points="12,74 32,68 50,70 68,54 86,50 104,36 126,22" />
                                    <circle class="gym-dot" cx="126" cy="22" r="5" />
                                    <text class="gym-label" x="12" y="20">kg</text>
                                </svg>
                            </div>

                            <div class="other-project-body">
                                <h4>
                                    <a
                                        class="card-title-link"
                                        href="/projects/gym-progress/"
                                    >
                                        Gym Progress System
                                        <span
                                            class="inline-arrow blue"
                                            aria-hidden="true">→</span
                                        >
                                    </a>
                                </h4>

                                <p>
                                    An Excel/VBA analytics system for tracking
                                    workouts, progression, historical data,
                                    diagnostics, and performance trends.
                                </p>

                                <SkillTagList
                                    skills={[
                                        "excel",
                                        "vba",
                                        "data-visualisation",
                                    ]}
                                />

                                <a
                                    class="view-link"
                                    href="/projects/gym-progress/"
                                    >View case study ↗</a
                                >
                            </div>
                        </article>
                    </div>

                    <div class="lab-strip" data-track="lab">
                        <p class="lab-label">Maths lab · generative side projects</p>

                        <div class="lab-grid">
                            <a class="lab-card math-card" href="/projects/math-wallpapers/">
                                <svg class="math-orbit" viewBox="0 0 200 120" aria-hidden="true">
                                    <path d={mathOrbitPath} />
                                </svg>
                                <span class="lab-copy">
                                    <strong>Mathematical OLED Wallpapers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></strong>
                                    <span>Volume 1: six true-black fractal wallpapers in 4K, built with a tested Python engine and JWildfire. Run the engines live in your browser.</span>
                                </span>
                            </a>

                            <a class="lab-card mandala-card" href="/projects/mandala-generator/">
                                <svg class="mandala-mini" viewBox="-60 -60 120 120" aria-hidden="true">
                                    {mandalaPetals.map((angle) => (
                                        <ellipse cx="0" cy="-28" rx="9" ry="24" transform={`rotate(${angle})`} />
                                    ))}
                                    <circle r="12" />
                                </svg>
                                <span class="lab-copy">
                                    <strong>Mandala & Coloring Puzzle Generator <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></strong>
                                    <span>Printable, reproducible mandala colouring pages from polar geometry. Colour the real SVGs or generate a new one.</span>
                                </span>
                            </a>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </section>
            </section>

            <!-- =================================================
                 ABOUT ME
                 ================================================= -->

            <section
                id="about"
                class="section about"
                aria-labelledby="about-title"
            >
                <p class="eyebrow">02 — About Me</p>

                <h2 id="about-title">
                    From running a business to building better systems.
                </h2>

                <p class="section-lead">
                    I'm Konstantinos, an operations-focused professional with a
                    background in e-commerce, marketplace management, data,
                    automation, and practical technology.
                </p>

                <div class="about-summary" aria-label="Professional summary">
                    <div>
                        <strong>Business ownership</strong>
                        <span>Seven years of direct marketplace operations.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Systems thinking</strong>
                        <span>Operational tools built around pricing, inventory, and reporting.</span>
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <strong>Current focus</strong>
                        <span>Workflow automation, data, and e-commerce operations.</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
<p>
                    From 2017 to 2024, I founded and operated Rocketeers, a
                    digital marketplace business that sold more than 23,000
                    items. Running the business gave me hands-on experience
                    across sourcing, pricing, inventory, order management,
                    customer experience, and commercial decision-making.
                </p>

                <p>
                    As the operation grew, I became increasingly interested in
                    solving the problems behind the work itself. I developed
                    Excel-based systems to streamline repricing, organize
                    inventory, and track business performance. That same
                    interest has since expanded into Python, AI-assisted
                    workflows, data analysis, and web development.
                </p>

                <p>
                    I enjoy combining an understanding of real operational
                    problems with the technical tools needed to solve them.
                    Whether I'm working with spreadsheets, code, data, or
                    marketplace systems, my goal is to make processes clearer,
                    more reliable, and easier to scale.
                </p>

                <p>
                    My recent automation work runs on Google Apps Script, n8n,
                    and PostgreSQL: a job funnel that reads nine applicant
                    tracking systems, and a pipeline that turns public museum
                    archives into reviewable product evidence. Language models
                    handle clearly defined steps, deduplication and validation
                    keep the data clean, and people make the final calls.
                </p>

                <!-- Professional focus areas -->
                <SkillLinks
                    variant="highlight"
                    skills={[
                        "marketplace-operations",
                        "excel",
                        "vba",
                        "ai-workflow-implementation",
                        "python",
                        "wordpress",
                        "operational-reporting",
                        "responsive-web-design",
                    ]}
                />
            </section>
            <!-- =================================================
                  SKILLS — CAPABILITIES SHOWN IN THE PROJECTS
                  ================================================= -->

            <section
                id="skills"
                class="section skills"
                aria-labelledby="skills-title"
            >
                <p class="eyebrow">03 — Skills</p>
                <h2 id="skills-title">Skills put into practice.</h2>
                <p class="section-lead">
                    A snapshot of the capabilities demonstrated across completed
                    projects and real operating work.
